ield","originalImage","label","创作者原图","items",[67],{"_63":64,"_25":68},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDA2ODk3Ni8yNTU4NTg5NS5wbmc=/original/HZA7lO.png","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The author’s Godot play-mode screenshot, retaining the original editor and debug panels.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/deep-yellow-claude.webp","alt","A first-person yellow-corridor encounter with a held bat, inventory and minimap, inside the creator’s captured Godot editor.","https://aebrer.itch.io/deep-yellow","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[94],"Claude Code","相关资源",[99,100],"resourceIds","section",{"_63":102,"_25":103},{"_63":94,"_25":101},"/zh/resources/claude-code/","Godot Engine · Official Documentation","/zh/resources/godot-engine/","创作者开发记录",[107],"evidence",{"_63":108,"_25":109,"_110":111},"查看 Claude Code 开发署名","https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow/blob/master/CREDITS.md#code-and-design","note","Creator attribution specifically names Claude via Claude Code. The itch page separately discloses AI assistance for code; no complete session transcript is supplied.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[116],{"_63":117,"_25":118,"_110":119},"查看完整 Godot 游戏","https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow","Full Godot 4.6 project, scenes, scripts, assets, shaders, and export presets. The itch page lists code MIT and assets CC0, while CREDITS.md still leaves the original-code license undecided and some third-party licenses unspecified; inspect both before reuse.","更多游玩入口",[123],"distribution",{"_63":124,"_25":125,"_110":126},"GitHub Releases","https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow/releases/tag/v0.13.0","Download — Prepared Windows and Linux builds, plus a self-hostable Web export. These are uploaded game builds, separate from automatic source archives. Release files were verified; native builds were not executed.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[132],{"_63":133,"_25":83,"_110":134},"Play DEEP YELLOW","In-development browser build plus Windows/Linux downloads. The creator recommends Chrome or a controller; Firefox mouse input has known problems. Includes horror themes and an interactive tutorial.","游戏平台","itch.io","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[142],{"_63":143,"_25":83,"_110":-7},"阅读作者的游戏与开发笔记","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[148,149,150,151],"Play the interactive tutorial and compare moving, waiting, equipment, and sanity.","Read the creator’s AI disclosure and the project’s separate attribution file.","Import project.godot in Godot 4.6 and inspect the start menu, procedural levels, and turn systems.","Change one equipment or turn rule, then test a complete run and restart.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Drew Brereton 明确说明游戏代码由 Claude 辅助开发。项目署名进一步指出使用了 Claude Code，并将原创内容与外部着色器、纹理和字体分开列出。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Godot 4.6 · GDScript","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[148,149,150,151],{"_63":187,"_25":83,"_17":188},{"_63":133,"_25":83,"_17":128,"_110":134},{"_63":184,"_25":118,"_185":186,"_110":119},{"_63":183,"_25":109,"_110":111},[181,182],[177],{"_178":124,"_25":125,"_17":179,"_110":180},"platform","download","Prepared Windows and Linux builds, plus a self-hostable Web export. These are uploaded game builds, separate from automatic source archives. Release files were verified; native builds were not executed.","godot-engine","claude-code","Read the explicit Claude Code credit","Open the complete Godot game","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s game and development notes","build-log",{"_190":191},"documents",{"_75":192,"_35":193},[195,199,200,201,198,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,197,234,196,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255],[194,195,196,197,198],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/design-system","design/v2/design-system","editorial-art-prompts","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-design/references/case-studies","skills/level-design/references/combat-balance","skills/level-design/references/culture-history","skills/level-design/references/foundations","skills/level-design/references/learning","skills/level-design/references/lighting-art","skills/level-design/references/optimization-release","skills/level-design/references/scripting-doors","skills/level-design/references/source-map","skills/level-design/references/spatial-layout","skills/level-design/references/tools-quake","skills/level-design/references/wayfinding-playtesting","skills/level-design/templates/level-brief","skills/level-design/templates/playtest-report","skills/level-design/templates/review"]
